{{!< default}}
{{!-- /student/ — .edu-gated student membership signup. Two options:
     Print + Digital ($50/yr) and Digital Only ($20/yr). The student
     email is validated client-side (student-checkout.js) and again by
     the mo-membership Worker (/api/create-student-checkout) before a
     Stripe Checkout subscription session is created. Like the group
     flow, the member is comped in Ghost via the Stripe webhook and
     revoked on customer.subscription.deleted.
     See website/workers/membership/lib/student.js. --}}

<main class="membership membership-support student-page">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Student Membership</p>
      <h1 class="page-hero-headline"><em>Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy</em> for students.</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">
        A discounted membership for students, verified with your school email. Full access to everything we publish, at a student rate.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="student-signup">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <form class="student-form" data-student-form novalidate>
        <fieldset class="student-options">
          <legend class="student-legend">Choose your membership</legend>

          <label class="student-option">
            <input type="radio" name="student-variant" value="print">
            <span class="student-option-body">
              <span class="student-option-head">
                <span class="student-option-name">Print + Digital</span>
                <span class="student-option-price">$50<span class="student-option-per">/year</span></span>
              </span>
              <span class="student-option-desc">Everything digital, plus the quarterly print journal mailed to you.</span>
            </span>
          </label>

          <label class="student-option">
            <input type="radio" name="student-variant" value="digital">
            <span class="student-option-body">
              <span class="student-option-head">
                <span class="student-option-name">Digital Only</span>
                <span class="student-option-price">$20<span class="student-option-per">/year</span></span>
              </span>
              <span class="student-option-desc">Full digital access. Everything except the print journal.</span>
            </span>
          </label>
        </fieldset>

        {{!-- Mailing address — revealed by student-checkout.js only when
             "Print + Digital" is selected (the journal ships physically).
             Carried through the confirm token → Stripe metadata →
             provisionStudent → member_addresses. --}}
        <div class="student-address" data-student-address hidden>
          <p class="student-address-legend">Where should we mail the journal?</p>
          <div class="student-field">
            <label class="student-field-label" for="student-addr-line1">Street address</label>
            <input class="student-field-input" type="text" id="student-addr-line1" name="student-addr-line1" autocomplete="address-line1" maxlength="120" data-student-addr-line1>
          </div>
          <div class="student-field">
            <label class="student-field-label" for="student-addr-line2">Apt, suite, etc. <span class="student-field-optional">(optional)</span></label>
            <input class="student-field-input" type="text" id="student-addr-line2" name="student-addr-line2" autocomplete="address-line2" maxlength="120" data-student-addr-line2>
          </div>
          <div class="student-name-row">
            <div class="student-field">
              <label class="student-field-label" for="student-addr-city">City</label>
              <input class="student-field-input" type="text" id="student-addr-city" name="student-addr-city" autocomplete="address-level2" maxlength="80" data-student-addr-city>
            </div>
            <div class="student-field">
              <label class="student-field-label" for="student-addr-state">State / Province</label>
              <input class="student-field-input" type="text" id="student-addr-state" name="student-addr-state" autocomplete="address-level1" maxlength="80" data-student-addr-state>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="student-name-row">
            <div class="student-field">
              <label class="student-field-label" for="student-addr-postal">ZIP / Postal code</label>
              <input class="student-field-input" type="text" id="student-addr-postal" name="student-addr-postal" autocomplete="postal-code" maxlength="20" data-student-addr-postal>
            </div>
            <div class="student-field">
              <label class="student-field-label" for="student-addr-country">Country</label>
              <select class="student-field-input student-field-select" id="student-addr-country" name="student-addr-country" data-student-addr-country>
                <option value="US" selected>United States</option>
                <option value="CA">Canada</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="student-name-row">
          <div class="student-field">
            <label class="student-field-label" for="student-first-name">First name</label>
            <input
              class="student-field-input"
              type="text"
              id="student-first-name"
              name="student-first-name"
              autocomplete="given-name"
              maxlength="60"
              data-student-first-name
              required
            >
          </div>
          <div class="student-field">
            <label class="student-field-label" for="student-last-name">Last name</label>
            <input
              class="student-field-input"
              type="text"
              id="student-last-name"
              name="student-last-name"
              autocomplete="family-name"
              maxlength="60"
              data-student-last-name
              required
            >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="student-field">
          <label class="student-field-label" for="student-school">Your school</label>
          <input
            class="student-field-input"
            type="text"
            id="student-school"
            name="student-school"
            autocomplete="organization"
            placeholder="e.g. Wheaton College"
            maxlength="120"
            data-student-school
            required
          >
        </div>

        <div class="student-field">
          <label class="student-field-label" for="student-grad-year">Graduation year</label>
          <select
            class="student-field-input student-field-select"
            id="student-grad-year"
            name="student-grad-year"
            data-student-grad-year
            required
          >
            <option value="" selected disabled>Select a year</option>
            <option value="2026">2026</option>
            <option value="2027">2027</option>
            <option value="2028">2028</option>
            <option value="2029">2029</option>
            <option value="2030">2030</option>
            <option value="2031">2031</option>
            <option value="2032">2032</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="student-field">
          <label class="student-field-label" for="student-email">Student email</label>
          <input
            class="student-field-input"
            type="email"
            id="student-email"
            name="student-email"
            inputmode="email"
            autocomplete="email"
            placeholder="you@school.edu"
            data-student-email
            required
          >
          <p class="student-field-hint">Use your school email ending in <strong>.edu</strong>. It's how we verify you're a student.</p>
        </div>

        <p class="student-error" data-student-error role="alert"></p>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" data-student-submit disabled>Email me a confirmation link</button>
        <p class="student-fineprint">We'll email a link to confirm your school address, then take you to checkout. This is a one-time annual payment, not a subscription. We'll remind you before it expires so you can renew.</p>
      </form>

      <div class="student-success" data-student-success hidden>
        <h2 class="student-success-heading"><em>Check your email</em></h2>
        <p>We sent a confirmation link to <strong data-student-success-email></strong>. Click it to confirm your school address and finish signing up.</p>
        <p class="student-success-note">The link works for one hour. If it doesn't arrive, check your spam folder, then try again.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="student-included">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <h2 class="student-included-heading"><em>What's included</em></h2>
      <ul class="student-included-list">
        <li>Every essay and the full 20-year archive</li>
        <li>Audio versions of essays</li>
        <li>Mere&nbsp;Fidelity and Christians Reading Classics</li>
        <li>The Weekly Digest</li>
        <li>The private Discord community of readers</li>
        <li>Member dashboard, bookmarks, and the commonplace book</li>
        <li>The quarterly print journal <span class="student-included-tag">Print + Digital</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="migrate-faq">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <details class="migrate-faq-item">
        <summary class="migrate-faq-summary">
          <h2 class="migrate-faq-title"><em>Who qualifies?</em></h2>
          <span class="migrate-faq-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="migrate-faq-body">
          <p>Anyone with a valid school email address ending in .edu. We verify by emailing a confirmation link to that address before checkout. Each year, you confirm your .edu again when you renew, which keeps you at the student rate.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="migrate-faq-item">
        <summary class="migrate-faq-summary">
          <h2 class="migrate-faq-title"><em>What's the difference between the two options?</em></h2>
          <span class="migrate-faq-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="migrate-faq-body">
          <p>Both give you full digital access to everything Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy publishes. The $50 option adds the quarterly print journal, mailed to you. The $20 option is digital only.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="migrate-faq-item">
        <summary class="migrate-faq-summary">
          <h2 class="migrate-faq-title"><em>What happens when I graduate?</em></h2>
          <span class="migrate-faq-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="migrate-faq-body">
          <p>Your student membership is a one-time annual payment, so it simply ends unless you renew. We'll email you in the last month and show a reminder in your dashboard. When you're ready, you can move to a full membership any time.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script src="{{asset "js/student-checkout.js"}}"></script>

</main>
